  "abstract": "Same RFFT-based FourierForecasterLN (p=36) with reduced dropout (0.05) and a slightly lower Adam lr=9e-4 to test stability. Loss: MAE + temporal curvature (\u03bb=1e-4); Clip=1.0.",
